OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy and dry into the
OL,7,Fevening. Turning cold again under
OL,8,Fclear spells and light winds with a
OL,9,Fgrass frost possible. Cloud builds and
OL,10,Fwinds freshen later on.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FWidely cloudy to start the
OL,13,Fday, with a band of light rain
OL,14,Fcrossing during the morning. Further
OL,15,Fpatchy rain follows. Temperatures just
OL,16,Fabove average. Fresh winds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
