OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,6,Fduring Tuesday morning clears to a
OL,7,Ffine, if a little breezy afternoon.
OL,8,FCloudy with some light rain possible
OL,9,Fon Wednesday. Further rain likely on
OL,10,FThursday. Fresh to strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
